    "explanation": "The episode closed after hospital evaluation, surgery, discharge planning, medication and wound instructions, pathology follow-up pathway, and emergency escalation rules were made explicit and the caregiver repeated the plan. Remaining uncertainty about pathology was acknowledged and assigned to neurosurgery follow-up rather than falsely closed.",
